---
// About Card Section (The craftsman & AI swarms behind the glow ups)
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <video class="about-bg" data-vsrc="/assets/about-art.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-hidden="true"></video>
  
  <div class="about-head">
    <span class="tag">About</span>
    <h2>The team behind<br><span class="blue">the glow ups.</span></h2>
  </div>

  <div class="about-stage">
    <div class="about-card">
      <p class="ac-top">&lsquo;IT TAKES ONE ARCHITECT AND AN AI SWARM&rsquo;</p>
      
      <div class="ac-field">
        <label>Principal Engineer & Designer</label>
        <div class="ac-name">Deslopify Studio Team</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="ac-field">
        <label>Philosophy</label>
        <p class="ac-blurb">
          We fix ugly, fragile software for a living. We rebuild the interfaces and workflow bottlenecks you gave up on. Claude and autonomous agents do the heavy lifting, our senior taste and systems engineering do the rest. Everything ships as polished designs plus deterministic code running on your phone the same week.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ac-cols">
        <div class="ac-col">
          <label>Core Deliverables</label>
          <ul>
            <li>Production UI/UX Systems</li>
            <li>Autonomous AI Agents</li>
            <li>Live Coded Prototypes</li>
            <li>Document Intelligence</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-col">
          <label>Engineering Weapons</label>
          <ul>
            <li>Claude 3.5 Sonnet</li>
            <li>LangGraph & FastAPI</li>
            <li>Astro & Next.js</li>
            <li>Zero Template Bloat</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <svg class="about-clip" viewBox="0 0 44 90" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M31 12 v52 a9 9 0 0 1 -18 0 V20 a6 6 0 0 1 12 0 v40 a3 3 0 0 1 -6 0 V24" fill="none" stroke="#9aa2ad" stroke-width="4.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>

    <figure class="about-photo ap-1">
      <span class="tape"></span>
      <img src="/assets/about-snap-2.jpg" alt="Designing at workstation" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </figure>
    
    <figure class="about-photo ap-2">
      <span class="tape tape-r"></span>
      <img src="/assets/about-snap-3.jpg" alt="Studio details" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </figure>
    
    <figure class="about-photo ap-3">
      <span class="tape"></span>
      <img src="/assets/about-snap-1.jpg" alt="Sprint architecture" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </figure>

    <svg class="about-doodle ad-1" viewBox="0 0 100 110" aria-hidden="true">
      <g fill="none" stroke="#1d1e24" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M50 8 L59 34 L86 35 L64 51 L72 78 L50 62 L28 78 L36 51 L14 35 L41 34 Z"/>
        <circle cx="44" cy="44" r="2.6" fill="#1d1e24"/>
        <circle cx="58" cy="44" r="2.6" fill="#1d1e24"/>
      </g>
    </svg>

    <svg class="about-doodle ad-2" viewBox="0 0 110 100" aria-hidden="true">
      <g fill="none" stroke="#1d1e24" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M55 30 C48 16 26 16 22 32 C18 47 38 62 55 74 C72 62 92 47 88 32 C84 16 62 16 55 30 Z"/>
        <circle cx="45" cy="40" r="2.6" fill="#1d1e24"/>
        <circle cx="63" cy="40" r="2.6" fill="#1d1e24"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>
